{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@preconcurrency","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"flatMap","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"SegmentOfResult","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"transform","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"@Sendable","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"@escaping","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/AsyncSequence\/Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sci7ElementQa"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SegmentOfResult","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sci12_ConcurrencyE7flatMapyAA017AsyncThrowingFlatC8SequenceVyxqd__Gqd__7ElementQzYaKcSciRd__lF15SegmentOfResultL_qd__mfp"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncThrowingFlatMapSequence","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/AsyncThrowingFlatMapSequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency28AsyncThrowingFlatMapSequenceV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SegmentOfResult","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sci12_ConcurrencyE7flatMapyAA017AsyncThrowingFlatC8SequenceVyxqd__Gqd__7ElementQzYaKcSciRd__lF15SegmentOfResultL_qd__mfp"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SegmentOfResult","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncSequence","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/AsyncSequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sci"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An error-throwing mapping closure. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"transform"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accepts an element of this sequence as its parameter and returns an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncSequence"},{"type":"text","text":". If "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"transform"},{"type":"text","text":" throws an error, the sequence ends."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"transform"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"return-value","level":2,"text":"Return Value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A single, flattened asynchronous sequence that contains all"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"elements in all the asynchronous sequences produced by "},{"code":"transform","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequence ends either when the last sequence created from the last"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"element from base sequence ends, or when "},{"code":"transform","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" throws an error."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this method to receive a single-level asynchronous sequence when your"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transformation produces an asynchronous sequence for each element."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In this example, an asynchronous sequence called "},{"code":"Counter","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" produces "},{"code":"Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"values from "},{"code":"1","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to "},{"code":"5","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The transforming closure takes the received "},{"code":"Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and returns a new "},{"code":"Counter","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" that counts that high. For example, when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transform receives "},{"code":"3","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" from the base sequence, it creates a new "},{"code":"Counter","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that produces the values "},{"code":"1","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"2","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"code":"3","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The "},{"code":"flatMap(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“flattens” the resulting sequence-of-sequences into a single"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"AsyncSequence","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". However, when the closure receives "},{"code":"4","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", it throws an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"error, terminating the sequence."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["do {","    let stream = Counter(howHigh: 5)","        .flatMap { (value) -> Counter in","            if value == 4 {","                throw MyError()","            }","            return Counter(howHigh: value)","        }","    for try await number in stream {","        print(number, terminator: \" \")","    }","} catch {","    print(error)","}","\/\/ Prints \"1 1 2 1 2 3 MyError() \""]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/AsyncMapSequence\/flatMap(_:)-5qysc"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates an asynchronous sequence that concatenates the results of calling"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type"